Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.72,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}تحس بحموضة وارتجاع شديد في المريء
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.72,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}You feel severe heartburn and reflux
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.80,0:00:05.95,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}غيّرت العلاج أكتر من مرة… ولفّيت ما بين الدكاترة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.80,0:00:05.95,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}You've changed treatments, gone from doctor to doctor,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.02,0:00:08.45,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وكل ما بتاخد العلاج وتيجي توقّفه
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.02,0:00:08.45,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}and every time you stop the medicine,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.55,0:00:10.68,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}ترجع تاني من نقطة الصفر
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.55,0:00:10.68,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}you're back to square one.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.74,0:00:14.15,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}تعرف إن الموضوع ممكن يكون بعيد تمامًا عن الحمض؟
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.74,0:00:14.15,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}Did you know it may have nothing to do with acid?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.22,0:00:17.95,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وإن في ضيف رخم هو اللي عامل لك المشكلة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.22,0:00:17.95,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}And that an annoying guest is causing the problem?
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.19,0:00:20.23,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}لحد أوائل التمانينات
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.19,0:00:20.23,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}Until the early '80s,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.30,0:00:21.78,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}الدكاترة كانوا معتقدين
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.30,0:00:21.78,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}doctors believed
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.78,0:00:25.08,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}إن زيادة الحمض في المعدة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.78,0:00:25.08,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}that excess stomach acid
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.15,0:00:29.25,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}السبب الرئيسي لها ممكن يكون الأكل اللي مش صحي
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.15,0:00:29.25,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}was mainly caused by unhealthy food
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.47,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}أو التوتر والضغط بتاع الشغل
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.47,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}or stress and work pressure,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.54,0:00:34.37,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}لحد ما اتنين من العلماء الأستراليين
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.54,0:00:34.37,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}until two Australian scientists
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.43,0:00:36.75,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}بدأوا يدوّروا على المشكلة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.43,0:00:36.75,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}started looking into the problem
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.82,0:00:39.53,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}ووصلوا لضيف رخم موجود معانا
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.82,0:00:39.53,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}and found an annoying guest living with us,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.61,0:00:42.26,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}واللي كلنا عارفينه… جرثومة المعدة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.61,0:00:42.26,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}one we all know: H. pylori.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.32,0:00:45.75,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}جرثومة المعدة بتعيش في طبقة من طبقات المعدة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.32,0:00:45.75,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}H. pylori lives in a layer of the stomach lining
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.21,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وتحمي نفسها
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.21,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}and protects itself,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.43,0:00:49.96,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}وتعيش في الوسط الحامضي الشديد
Dialogue: 2,0:00:47.43,0:00:49.96,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}surviving in a highly acidic environment
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.03,0:00:52.61,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}عن طريق تظبيط البيئة المحيطة بيها
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.03,0:00:52.61,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}by adjusting the environment around it.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.67,0:00:54.79,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}تبدأ تستقر في جدار المعدة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.67,0:00:54.79,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}It settles into the stomach wall,
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.86,0:00:58.41,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}تعمل لك التهابات… وأحيانًا قُرحة في المعدة
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.86,0:00:58.41,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}causing inflammation… and sometimes a stomach ulcer.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.48,0:01:00.57,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}علاجها سهل وبسيط
Dialogue: 2,0:00:58.48,0:01:00.57,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}Its treatment is easy and simple,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.67,0:01:04.43,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}بس الأهم… لازم التشخيص الصح والدقيق
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.67,0:01:04.43,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}but first you need an accurate diagnosis
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.68,0:01:08.12,Ar,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(540,1180)\fad(80,80)\fscx94\fscy94\t(0,140,\fscx100\fscy100)}عشان نبدأ العلاج بشكل مظبوط
Dialogue: 2,0:01:04.68,0:01:08.12,En,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,1236)\fad(80,80)}so we can start the right treatment.
